Subject: [PATCH 2/6] F635-4: an attack sequence entry's CustomBuffOnDamageTime
 (data 16.635.3)

Data 16.635.3 gives the hero Electro Wizard's two surge entries CustomBuffOnDamageTime 600 in
place of the row's BuffOnDamageTime 500 (ZapFreeze). The entry the index selects at the hit, at
any length of the order as the entry's other custom columns, times the row's buff on damage; the
queued direct hit carries that time to the drain, where the buff is applied. An entry without it
keeps the row's time. From the tables (b).
Core tests: 16.402.22 2146/0; 16.635.3 (guard bypassed for the run) 13 -> 11 failures.
